        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Guetta, Rihanna, Estelle\n- Products: One Love, One More Love, Who's That Chick?\n\nFacts:\n- David Guetta released his fourth studio album \"One Love\" in 2009.\n- \"One Love\" included tracks featuring Barbadian recording artist Rihanna and British recording artist Estelle.\n- David Guetta reissued \"One Love\" as \"One More Love\" in 2010.\n- \"Who's That Chick?\" is a song by French DJ David Guetta from the 2010 reissue \"One More Love\" of the 2009 album \"One Love\".",
